 Technical Hints
 ---------------

   You will find the following file after  and  during  the  usage  of
   TAFileTagger: <username>.tagger. The tagged files, separated with a
   space. (In T:) UserUploads.dat<n> Data to  the  last  Uploads.  (In
   BBS:System)


   And following Environmentvariables:


    <username>.bytes.<line> Count of the tagged Bytes.
    <username>.files.<line> Count of the tagged Files.
    <username>.sort.<line>  Used Sortoption.
    <username>.drift.<line> Used Sortdrift.
    TAUpload                Set to 1 when the user takes an upload.



